{"id":4490,"date":"2025-06-27T14:10:25","date_gmt":"2025-06-27T13:10:25","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/cc-ac.org\/?p=4490"},"modified":"2025-10-08T16:33:11","modified_gmt":"2025-10-08T15:33:11","slug":"aurelie-fontan-and-gorran-school-fashion-a-better-future-in-cornwall","status":"publish","type":"post","link":"https:\/\/cc-ac.org\/aurelie-fontan-and-gorran-school-fashion-a-better-future-in-cornwall\/","title":{"rendered":"Aur\u00e9lie Fontan and Gorran School fashion a better future in Cornwall"},"content":{"rendered":"\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image aligncenter size-large\"><img decoding=\"async\" width=\"1024\" height=\"681\" data-src=\"https:\/\/cc-ac.org\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/06\/main-image-1-1024x681.png\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-4496 lazyload\" data-srcset=\"https:\/\/cc-ac.org\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/06\/main-image-1-1024x681.png 1024w, https:\/\/cc-ac.org\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/06\/main-image-1-300x199.png 300w, https:\/\/cc-ac.org\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/06\/main-image-1-768x511.png 768w, https:\/\/cc-ac.org\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/06\/main-image-1-301x200.png 301w, https:\/\/cc-ac.org\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/06\/main-image-1-188x125.png 188w, https:\/\/cc-ac.org\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/06\/main-image-1.png 1536w\" data-sizes=\"(max-width: 1024px) 100vw, 1024px\" src=\"data:image\/svg+xml;base64,PHN2ZyB3aWR0aD0iMSIgaGVpZ2h0PSIxIiB4bWxucz0iaHR0cDovL3d3dy53My5vcmcvMjAwMC9zdmciPjwvc3ZnPg==\" style=\"--smush-placeholder-width: 1024px; --smush-placeholder-aspect-ratio: 1024\/681;\" \/><\/figure>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"has-text-align-center has-small-font-size wp-block-paragraph\">Aur\u00e9lie Fontan with Rowena who is modelling the winning co-design outfit.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Fashion and textile designer <a href=\"https:\/\/cc-ac.org\/ccac-co-designer-aurelie-fontan-wins-young-innovators-next-steps-award\/\">Aur\u00e9lie Fontan&#8217;s<\/a> CCAC co-design project with year 5 children at Gorran School reaches its exciting conclusion.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">This <a href=\"https:\/\/cc-ac.org\/springing-into-action-updates-from-this-terms-ccac-co-design-programmes\/\">summer<\/a>, children at Gorran School in Cornwall learned about the environmental footprint of the fashion industry and how creative, sustainable design methods and materials can disrupt this lamentable record. Inspired by plant-based dyes and kombucha leather, the children then worked in groups to design outfits suitable for the year 2100.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">As part of this co-design project, the children learned about the causes of climate change and were made aware of how Cornwall&#8217;s climate may change during their lifetimes. Working in small groups, this learning was captured in their outfit designs with practical suggestions for flippers, cotton, sun hats, water-proof clothing and recycled materials.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image aligncenter size-large is-resized\"><img decoding=\"async\" width=\"801\" height=\"1024\" data-src=\"https:\/\/cc-ac.org\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/06\/screenprinting-1-801x1024.png\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-4505 lazyload\" style=\"--smush-placeholder-width: 801px; --smush-placeholder-aspect-ratio: 801\/1024;width:716px;height:auto\" data-srcset=\"https:\/\/cc-ac.org\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/06\/screenprinting-1-801x1024.png 801w, https:\/\/cc-ac.org\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/06\/screenprinting-1-235x300.png 235w, https:\/\/cc-ac.org\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/06\/screenprinting-1-768x982.png 768w, https:\/\/cc-ac.org\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/06\/screenprinting-1-156x200.png 156w, https:\/\/cc-ac.org\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/06\/screenprinting-1-98x125.png 98w, https:\/\/cc-ac.org\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/06\/screenprinting-1.png 1024w\" data-sizes=\"(max-width: 801px) 100vw, 801px\" src=\"data:image\/svg+xml;base64,PHN2ZyB3aWR0aD0iMSIgaGVpZ2h0PSIxIiB4bWxucz0iaHR0cDovL3d3dy53My5vcmcvMjAwMC9zdmciPjwvc3ZnPg==\" \/><\/figure>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"has-text-align-center has-small-font-size wp-block-paragraph\">Aur\u00e9lie Fontan demonstrating the process of screen printing during the workshops at Gorran School.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Two groups of children had their outfit designs selected to be developed into a material reality by Aur\u00e9lie. The winning outfit incorporated old duvet buttons, a re-used zip and seaweed in a glamorous dress designed for a marine biologist. The second-placed outfit suggested that recycled polyester with a water-proof coating should be used for trousers for an underwater architect.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">These outfits were then modelled at the brilliant reveal event at Gorran School, where parents witnessed the co-design project &#8216;Fashioning a Better Future&#8217; reach its conclusion.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image aligncenter size-large\"><img decoding=\"async\" width=\"1024\" height=\"615\" data-src=\"https:\/\/cc-ac.org\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/06\/1-1024x615.png\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-4497 lazyload\" data-srcset=\"https:\/\/cc-ac.org\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/06\/1-1024x615.png 1024w, https:\/\/cc-ac.org\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/06\/1-300x180.png 300w, https:\/\/cc-ac.org\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/06\/1-768x461.png 768w, https:\/\/cc-ac.org\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/06\/1-333x200.png 333w, https:\/\/cc-ac.org\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/06\/1-200x120.png 200w, https:\/\/cc-ac.org\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/06\/1.png 1406w\" data-sizes=\"(max-width: 1024px) 100vw, 1024px\" src=\"data:image\/svg+xml;base64,PHN2ZyB3aWR0aD0iMSIgaGVpZ2h0PSIxIiB4bWxucz0iaHR0cDovL3d3dy53My5vcmcvMjAwMC9zdmciPjwvc3ZnPg==\" style=\"--smush-placeholder-width: 1024px; --smush-placeholder-aspect-ratio: 1024\/615;\" \/><\/figure>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"has-text-align-center has-small-font-size wp-block-paragraph\">The group winners\u2019 final designs next to Aur\u00e9lie\u2019s professional interpretations.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">CCAC is delighted with the outcome of this co-design collaboration and would like to thank the staff at Gorran School, Aur\u00e9lie and her colleagues for all their hard work in making the project a reality.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Aur\u00e9lie Fontan is a recipient of the 2024\/25 CCAC Young Designer\u2019s Award which is kindly supported by the Linbury Trust.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image alignleft size-large is-resized\"><img decoding=\"async\" width=\"1024\" height=\"434\" data-src=\"https:\/\/cc-ac.org\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/01\/Linbury-colour-1024x434.jpg\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-4108 lazyload\" style=\"--smush-placeholder-width: 1024px; --smush-placeholder-aspect-ratio: 1024\/434;width:355px;height:auto\" data-srcset=\"https:\/\/cc-ac.org\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/01\/Linbury-colour-1024x434.jpg 1024w, https:\/\/cc-ac.org\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/01\/Linbury-colour-300x127.jpg 300w, https:\/\/cc-ac.org\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/01\/Linbury-colour-768x325.jpg 768w, https:\/\/cc-ac.org\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/01\/Linbury-colour-1536x651.jpg 1536w, https:\/\/cc-ac.org\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/01\/Linbury-colour-2048x867.jpg 2048w, https:\/\/cc-ac.org\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/01\/Linbury-colour-360x152.jpg 360w, https:\/\/cc-ac.org\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/01\/Linbury-colour-200x85.jpg 200w\" data-sizes=\"(max-width: 1024px) 100vw, 1024px\" src=\"data:image\/svg+xml;base64,PHN2ZyB3aWR0aD0iMSIgaGVpZ2h0PSIxIiB4bWxucz0iaHR0cDovL3d3dy53My5vcmcvMjAwMC9zdmciPjwvc3ZnPg==\" \/><\/figure>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\"><\/p>\n","protected":false},"excerpt":{"rendered":"<p>Fashion and textile designer Aur\u00e9lie Fontan\u2019s   CCAC co-design project with year 5 children at Gorran School reaches its exciting conclusion.<\/p>\n","protected":false},"author":9,"featured_media":4495,"comment_status":"open","ping_status":"open","sticky":false